              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabanika zonke izingubo ezahlukene; kepha uBenjamini wamnika amashekeli angamakhulu amathathu esiliva nezingubo zangaphansi eziyisihlanu.",
          "type": "text",
